{"id": "a01f2f27-e747-4bc6-ace2-4aa14e8cd460", "timestamp": "2026-10-22T17:34:29.790954", "source": "environment", "parent_id": "8c5e61ae-6695-4b9e-a099-5b015d74b52a", "tool_name": "execute_check", "tool_call_id": "call-3f08dccb-8242-43b9-89b1-0885dfbc53a8", "observation": {"content": [{"cache_prompt": false, "type": "text", "text": "{\"phase\": \"exploration\", \"command\": \"curl -s --max-time 3 -o /dev/null -w \\\"HTTP %{http_code}\\\\n\\\" https://pypi.org 2>&1; echo \\\"---\\\"; curl -s --max-time 3 -o /dev/null -w \\\"HTTP %{http_code}\\\\n\\\" https://www.rdkit.org 2>&1\", \"exit_code\": 6, \"timed_out\": false, \"elapsed_seconds\": 0.016, \"output\": \"HTTP 000\\n---\\nHTTP 000\\n\", \"output_truncated\": false}"}], "is_error": false, "kind": "BenchmarkObservation"}, "action_id": "41ad06aa-27fe-4408-bb2c-cf17f3522174", "extended_content": [], "kind": "ObservationEvent", "source_event_index": 19}
{"id": "93cef0ba-39bd-4775-848c-15b0464462cc", "timestamp": "2026-10-22T17:35:08.458060", "source": "agent", "parent_id": "a01f2f27-e747-4bc6-ace2-4aa14e8cd460", "action": null, "tool_name": "end_researcher_turn", "tool_call_id": "call-0900ae36-0a95-406a-b6fc-b29ef4209ed9", "tool_call": {"id": "call-0900ae36-0a95-406a-b6fc-b29ef4209ed9", "responses_item_id": null, "name": "end_researcher_turn", "arguments": "{\"summary\":\"Submit initial inspection and plan overview\",\"stage\":\"plan\",\"answer\":\"## 1. 输入与仓库检查 (Initial Inspection)\\n\\n**仓库当前内容**：\\n- `/workspace` 下仅有一个 `task.json`，无任何数据文件、脚本、Notebook、依赖清单或既有日志。\\n- `task.json` 内容要点：`question=\\\"How can you extract and analyze basic molecular properties from a chemical dataset?\\\"`，`context` 明确\\\"Design an experiment… Do not claim that an experiment was run\\\"；附带 `documents.track.md=\\\"Design-only task; repositories and compute are not required.\\\"`\\n- → 结论：**本任务为纯设计任务**。现实跑通的\\\"实验\\\"不在交付范围，交付物是实验设计方案文档本体。\\n\\n**环境可用性快速摸底**（用于方案可行性评估，非执行证据）：\\n\\n| 项 | 状态 |\\n|---|---|\\n| Python | 3.12.3，`/usr/bin/python3` |\\n| pip | 24.0 可用，但系统为 externally-managed（PEP 668），需 `python3 -m venv` |\\n| 已装关键包 | **rdkit / pandas / numpy / matplotlib / seaborn 均未安装** |\\n| 网络 | 禁用（PyPI、rdkit.org 均为 `HTTP 000`） |\\n| apt | 缓存损坏（`sources.list` 缺失），`apt-cache` 不可用 |\\n| 磁盘 | `/workspace` 所在卷剩余 ~707 GB |\\n| GPU | 无（任务无需） |\\n\\n**派生结论**：\\n- 由于 `documents.track.md` 已声明 \\\"repositories and compute are not required\\\"，方案不依赖真实的 `pip install`，但仍需在文档中说明\\\"如果真实执行，环境需 venv + 离线 wheel 预置\\\"这一前提。\\n- 由于无数据集、且无网络，方案必须假设输入数据形态由研究员指定或作为方案附录列出\\\"可接受的输入清单\\\"。\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. 建议实验设计方案概览 (Brief Overview, 非完整方案)\\n\\n> 仅给出设计骨架与关键选择，待研究员确认后再展开为完整方案。\\n\\n**2.1 输入数据假设**\\n- 主要假设：输入为 **SMILES 列表**（`.smi`、`.txt`、或 `.csv` 中一列名为 `smiles` 的字段）；并兼容 **InChI** 与 **SDF** 作为可识别分支。\\n- 结构规范化流水线（顺序即为防错的顺序）：\\n  1. 用 RDKit `Chem.MolFromSmiles` / `Chem.MolFromInchi` 解析，捕获解析失败行写入 `parse_failures.log`。\\n  2. 中和电荷与去盐：`rdkit.Chem.MolStandardize.rdMolStandardize.Uncharger` + `LargestFragmentChooser`。\\n  3. RDKit 的 `Chem.SanitizeMol`（保留默认 sanitize flags，捕获但保留异常）。\\n  4. 标准化 SMILES 输出（`Chem.MolToSmiles(canonical=True, isomericSmiles=True)`），用作去重键。\\n  5. 去重策略：相同 canonical SMILES 仅保留第一次出现（保留原始索引以便追溯）。\\n- 规模假设：在无小批量限制下，方案同时给出<1k、1k–50k、>50k 三档规模的处理注意事项（向量化计算、chunksize、日志频率）。\\n\\n**2.2 计划抽取的\\\"基本分子性质\\\"集合**\\n- 物理化学类：**MW (ExactMolWt / MolWt)**、**LogP (Crippen MolLogP)**、**MR (Crippen MolMR)**、**TPSA**、**HBD / HBA (Lipinski)**、**RotBonds**。\\n- 拓扑/结构类：**HeavyAtomCount**、**RingCount**、**AromaticRings / AromaticAtomCount**、**FractionCSP3**。\\n- Lipinski 五规则衍生判定：**Ro5_pass**（MW≤500、LogP≤5、HBD≤5、HBA≤10）+ 违规计数 `Ro5_violations`。\\n- 异常识别：**PAINS**（`FilterCatalog` 的 `FilterCatalogParams.FilterCatalogs.PAINS_A/B/C`）作为可选标注。\\n- **可选/按研究员确认纳入**：`QED`、`BertzCT`、`NumHeteroatoms`、`FormalCharge`、3D 描述符（无 3D 输入则跳过，明确声明）。\\n\\n**2.3 工具栈与离线策略**\\n- 主选：**RDKit + pandas + numpy + matplotlib**（必要时 seaborn 仅用于热图）。\\n- 不引入 Open Babel（因 rdkit 已覆盖本任务全部描述符）。\\n- 离线预案（写进方案附录）：研究方需在执行前于可联网机器准备 `wheelhouse/`（rdkit‑cp3x‑manylinux、pandas、numpy、matplotlib 均可用 prebuilt wheel），目标机器 `python3 -m venv .venv && pip install --no-index --find-links=wheelhouse/ …`。\\n- 由于本任务不实际运行，方案中以\\\"导入+最小冒烟\\\"作为可行性的代码骨架论证（说明若运行即受 PEP 668 与离线两大约束）。\\n\\n**2.4 分析维度**\\n- 单变量分布：每个描述符给出直方图（连续型）+ 计数柱状图（整数型/违反类）；统计摘要（min/q1/median/q3/max、mean、std）。\\n- 双变量相关性：Pearson 与 Spearman 相关矩阵热图；对高度共线描述符（如 MW 与 HeavyAtomCount）给出冗余提示。\\n- 分类视角：Ro5 通过/失败的占比、PAINS 命中占比。\\n- 异常识别：超阈值分子（任一描述符落在 ±4σ 之外，或 Ro5 违规 ≥2）的清单（含 SMILES 与索引）。\\n- 仅在样本量同质且无版权问题时做简单 substructure 分组对比（否则禁用）。\\n\\n**2.5 输出形式（在 `/workspace` 下）**\\n- `results/basic_properties.csv`：原始描述符（每行一分子，含 canonical_smiles 与 source_index）。\\n- `results/basic_properties_summary.tsv`：每个描述符的描述性统计。\\n- `results/correlations.csv` + `results/correlation_heatmap.png`：相关矩阵。\\n- `results/distributions/*.png`：每个描述符一张分布图。\\n- `results/ro5_summary.tsv`、`results/anomalies.csv`、`results/parse_failures.log`。\\n- `DESIGN.md`：实验设计文档本体（含数据契约、参数表、可复现性说明、离线步骤、局限性）。\\n- 不上传任何外部数据；输出路径全部在 `/workspace` 内。\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. 关键假设与不确定性清单\\n\\n需在 `stage=result` 之前由研究员明确 / 选择的设计选择：\\n\\n1. **数据集来源与版权**\\n   - 当前无任何数据集。是否需要由研究方提供具体数据文件 URL / 字段示例？还是方案必须对**多种可能数据**（如 ChEMBL 子集、Tox21、某内部库）分别给适配路径？\\n   - 关联方版权：ChEMBL/PubChem 走 CC‑BY 类许可；私有/内部数据需研究方确认能否写入 repositories。\\n\\n2. **样本规模**\\n   - 若 < 1k：跳过 Spearman 相关讨论，分布以 1‑bin 直方图替代。\\n   - 若 1k–50k：标准方案。\\n   - 若 > 100k：必须讨论分块、内存与耗时；是否要求 `NUMEXPR/Blosc` 等加速（默认否）。\\n   - **未确定**：本任务采用哪一档默认假设？\\n\\n3. **\\\"基本分子性质\\\"具体范围**\\n   - 最小集合：MW、LogP、HBD、HBA、TPSA（5 项）。\\n   - 标准集合：上述 5 项 + RotBonds、HeavyAtomCount、AromaticRings、MR、FractionCSP3（10 项）。\\n   - 扩展集合：标准 + Ro5 判定 + PAINS 标注 + QED（BertzCT 可在方案中作为\\\"备注\\\"。\\n   - **未确定**：要哪个集合？\\n\\n4. **是否纳入 Ro5 与 PAINS 等规则性判定**\\n   - Ro5：纯派生计算，无版权争议，几乎必含。\\n   - PAINS：RDKit 内置 FilterCatalog，免额外数据；但部分文献建议同时给 `PAINS_A/B/C` 拆解统计。是否需要拆解？\\n   - **未确定**：是否纳入 `PAINS` 与 `BRENK` 这类规则集合（PAINS 倾向含，BRENK 倾向不含以保持\\\"基本\\\"）。\\n\\n5. **工具栈与依赖**\\n   - **已可确认**：因本任务为设计 + 现实环境网络禁用 + PEP 668，**不实际安装执行**。\\n   - **写进方案**：是否需提供 `requirements.txt`（写好了放在方案附录但假定离线安装）。\\n   - **替代路径**：是否允许在方案中以 `conda env` 或 `micromamba docker` 作为离线执行前提？\\n\\n6. **可视化与输出位置**\\n   - 当前已选定 `/workspace/results/` 与 `/workspace/DESIGN.md`，但需研究员确认 `DESIGN.md` 是否为最终交付物文件名（可换成 `experiment_design.md`/`report.md`）。\\n   - 是否需要提供 PDF / 一页摘要？默认否。\\n\\n7. **结构规范化时的\\\"严格度\\\"**\\n   - 严格度 A：仅去盐、保留立体。\\n   - 严格度 B：去盐 + 去立体（去掉 `@`/`@@` & `\\\\`/`/`），便于统计聚合但不区分对映异构体。\\n   - **未确定**：默认 A，但对去重逻辑与异常识别的影响需研究员权衡。\\n\\n8. **异常识别阈值**\\n   - 默认方案建议 `|z| > 4` 或 `Ro5_violations ≥ 2`，但分子指纹/3D 描述符不在基本性质范围。\\n   - **未确定**：研究员是否接受这一阈值或要更保守（如 `|z| > 3.5`）。\\n\\n9. **任务元约束复核**\\n   - `document.track.md` 声明\\\"repositories and compute are not required\\\"，与 `environment` 中 \\\"bubblewrap / disabled network / packages not preinstalled\\\" 看似矛盾：以 `track.md` 为准（Documents 优先）。方案在文档中会显式声明\\\"该任务不进行实际实验\\\"。\\n\\n10. **任何本节未列的隐性约束**\\n    - 是否需要在方案中给定可复现性章节（`git commit hash`、随机种子、依赖版本锁定）？默认需要。\\n    - 是否需要在方案中给\\\"无输入退化场景\\\"的处理（比如空文件、单分子、全失败行）？默认需要。\\n\\n---\\n\\n**待研究员的明确决定（第 3 节各项确认）后**，我将进入 `stage=result`，产出包含完整数据契约、参数表、伪代码骨架、目录清单、可复现性说明、局限性、可行性自检与附录（离线 wheel 列表、PEP 668 处理）的最终 `DESIGN.md`。\",\"evidence\":\"### Direct repository observations\\n- `/workspace` listing: only `task.json` present; no data, scripts, notebooks, requirements, logs.\\n- `task.json` contents (parsed): question; context \\\"Do not claim that an experiment was run\\\"; `documents.track.md = \\\"Design-only task; repositories and compute are not required.\\\"`\\n\\n### Environment probes used only to assess feasibility (not as experiment execution)\\n- `python3 --version` → `Python 3.12.3`.\\n- `python3 -c 'import rdkit/pandas/numpy/matplotlib/seaborn'` → all `ModuleNotFoundError`. Confirmed in a single command output.\\n- `pip --version` → `pip 24.0`; `pip install --dry-run rdkit` → \\\"error: externally-managed-environment\\\" (PEP 668).\\n- `curl --max-time 3 https://pypi.org` and `https://www.rdkit.org` → both `HTTP 000` (network disabled confirmed).\\n- `apt-cache search …` → \\\"W: Unable to read /etc/apt/sources.list\\\" (apt cache unavailable).\\n- `df -h /workspace` → 707 GB free volume storage.\\n\\n### Logical inferences (stated as assumptions, given design-only mandate)\\n- Because `documents.track.md` declares a design-only task with no repository/compute requirement, the deliverable is the design document itself; scalability tables, sklearn-style pipelines, and reproducibility checklists are part of the document, not of executed code.\\n- Because networks are disabled, PEP 668 is active, and no data file exists, every operational step in the document must be paired with an explicit offline / \\\"must pre-install\\\" caveat, and data ingestion must be expressed as parameterised assumptions rather than concrete file reads.\",\"assumptions\":\"1. The deliverable is an experiment design document (DESIGN.md under /workspace); a real run is explicitly out of scope per documents.track.md=\\\"Design-only task; repositories and compute are not required.\\\" 2. Canonical task input is assumed to be a SMILES list or a CSV with a 'smiles' column; InChI and SDF are accepted branches documented in the design but not required. 3. The toolchain assumed is RDKit + pandas + numpy + matplotlib; seaborn kept optional for the correlation heatmap. Open Babel is excluded. 4. Computation of any descriptor, sanitisation, and canonicalisation is predefined within RDKit's documented behaviour (Lipinski HBD/HBA, Crippen LogP/MR, TPSA, NumRotatableBonds, descriptors.*, FilterCatalog for PAINS). 5. Output goes under /workspace/results/ and the design file under /workspace/, all non-executable text artefacts. 6. The \\\"basic properties\\\" set in §2.2 is the proposed default (10 standard descriptors + Lipinski Ro5 + optional PAINS); final scope required from researcher. 7. Heuristics for outlier ID default to |z|>4 or Ro5_violations≥2; thresholds to be confirmed by researcher.\",\"uncertainties\":\"1. Actual dataset source, file path, format, licensing, and approximate size — no data or docs in repository beyond task.json. 2. Whether Ro5 and PAINS rules must be in the deliverables, and whether PAINS should be split into A/B/C subsets. 3. Whether to keep stereochemistry (strictness A) or strip it before aggregation (strictness B). 4. The final name of the deliverable (DESIGN.md vs experiment_design.md vs report.md) andber of visualisations expected. 5. Whether off-line dependency provisioning (pre-built wheelhouse, conda env, or docker) budget is acceptable; the design can only describe the operations, not the environment bootstrap. 6. Whether randomly in the design that the task is design-only this also precludes pseudo execution / minimal smoke test demonstrations — researcher must confirm whether the design may include a clearly-labelled \\\"pseudo-code/abstraction\\\" section or must be purely narrative. 7. Substructure grouping (e.g., ring-system summary) is in scope as a \\\"optional extended\\\" module — confirmation required. 8. Reproducibility requirements (random seed, library version pinning) — included by default but researcher can downgrade.\"}", "origin": "completion"}, "llm_response_id": "chatcmpl-2465a72c-cb7d-46b8-a894-b8420e994039", "security_risk": "UNKNOWN", "kind": "ActionEvent", "source_event_index": 20}
